category: Libs
build-depends: cygport doxygen
sdesc: "Small C library for x86 CPU detection and feature extraction (utilities)"
ldesc: "libcpuid provides CPU identification for the x86 (and x86_64). For details
about the programming API, you might want to take a look at the project's
website on sourceforge (https://libcpuid.sourceforge.net/). There you'd find a
short tutorial, as well as the full API reference."
